  "notes": "FORMS:\n{目覚|めざ}まし is the short form of {目覚|めざ}まし{時計|どけい} (alarm clock). Both forms are commonly used.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {目覚|めざ}ましをかける/セットする - to set the alarm\n- {目覚|めざ}ましが{鳴|な}る - for the alarm to go off\n- {目覚|めざ}ましを{止|と}める - to turn off the alarm\n- {目覚|めざ}ましで{起|お}きる - to wake up by alarm\n\nMODERN USAGE:\nMany people now use smartphone alarms (スマホのアラーム) instead of traditional alarm clocks.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {目覚|めざ}まし{時計|どけい} - alarm clock (full form)\n- アラーム - alarm (loanword)\n- {起|お}きる - to wake up\n- {起|お}こす - to wake someone up",
